WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,710
Tell me

2
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:02,040
Why don't I let frozen powder

3
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:03,810
his son

4
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:05,450
Something will happen in a year

5
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,660
If you move the powder at this time

6
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,780
A year later, something happened to Wang Guodong’s son.

7
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,540
Their family will blame him

8
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:12,860
I originally made the mistake of staying at Wang Guodong

9
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:13,820
In this way

10
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,020
Instead, he made a mess

11
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,910
I had a great time some time ago

12
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,670
The walls of your old house are soaked in water

13
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:24,230
Come back and take care of it. Don't wait for him.

14
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,990
You can bring that great immortal back too.

15
00:00:25,990 --> 00:00:27,310
My leg hurts so much

16
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,780
The leaking house is a cover-up

17
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,020
He wants me to go back and look after him

18
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,140
Then shall we go?

19
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,960
You can't stay in your grandfather's old house

20
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,490
His father and grandfather both drowned

21
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:41,850
I heard he is coming back this time

22
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:43,730
It's because the house is leaking, you see?

23
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:46,450
I'd rather follow this boy and see if I've ever had one, I'm sure we can talk about it.

24
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:47,530
Dear sons of God

25
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:48,770
long time no see

26
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,250
We have a long way to go

27
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:52,170
I don’t plan to leave when I come back this time

28
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:53,090
Wait until you have time

29
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,410
Visiting door to door

30
00:00:57,980 --> 00:00:59,060
Come back this time

31
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:00,380
It feels better than leaving

32
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,510
Xiaoti Daxian

33
00:01:02,510 --> 00:01:08,470
You guys are here for the snakeskin

34
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:09,510
Still bloody
